    dct:description "The turnover and relict predictions are testable using large public fossil and phylogenetic resources. Habitat biases and the indirect inference from small area to weak competition limit causal resolution." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Compare freshwater, marine and terrestrial lineages for origination, extinction, lineage age and phylogenetic distinctiveness. Slower turnover and a greater excess of old isolated lineages in freshwater support the prediction, although competition would require separate evidence." ;
